{"v":4,"catch":"他們沒有被摧毀...","desc":"《 THUNDER CROSS II》是由KONAMI於1991年發行的射擊遊戲。\n控制Blue Thunder 2和Red Thunder 2並為銀河系的生存而戰。\n升級您的武器，增加選擇以擊敗首領。\n還可提供兩人合作模式。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2021-04-28","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7bb5b7311ab8b78f7e4bd5c46088d853f510df2a162cc208e75c130e12555f1c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f14755a12ae957dc8ab1fa840918a56f9bce57936d2ea4f8d762ec87237d2c78.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/906210c91d6a57b9dbfcc9e2fe8b08b5f3b2439dcc9a6e507971587c29ef8275.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1f0d2c49960db75f3d7e80822acfe11f122336a2d6d45b61a5ee9493e4093a64.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/221e02a22076db81a4d1867176f409c3745881fe541de9b7100e9f9320b84c9f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/62efa1b4ea69b2ef8d2731f6a24ba3100fa1dd669499d01d6f5804df73df916e.jpg"],"titleId":"0100f400144c6000","dlc":[]}